```
- Stores computed analysis as JSON
- Pre-calculated results for fast dashboard rendering

**Design Decisions:**

**Why JSON columns for analysis results?**
- Complex nested data structures (arrays of objects)
- Read-heavy workload (calculated once, read many times)
- Flexible schema (add new analysis without migrations)

**Why separate FileMetadata table?**
- Enable complex analytics queries (GROUP BY, aggregations)
- Indexed for fast filtering and sorting
- Supports incremental updates (add more servers)

**Why foreign keys?**
- Cascade deletes (delete project → delete all related data)
- Referential integrity (can't orphan records)
- Query optimization (database knows relationships)

